### Variables
@baseUrl = https://checker.eteteleverse.com/
@apiUrl = {{baseUrl}}/api

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/ping

### ===================================
### DOCS API (Google Sheets Data)
### ===================================

### Get all data from Google Sheets
GET {{apiUrl}}/docs

### Refresh data from Google Sheets
GET {{apiUrl}}/docs/refresh

### Get data by category
GET {{apiUrl}}/docs/category/aification

### Search transactions
GET {{apiUrl}}/docs/search?query=test&fields=description

### Get duplicates report
GET {{apiUrl}}/docs/duplicates

### Get statistics
GET {{apiUrl}}/docs/stats

### ===================================
### EMAIL API
### ===================================

### Get email history
GET {{apiUrl}}/email/history

### Get email statistics
GET {{apiUrl}}/email/stats

### ===================================
### AUTH API
### ===================================

### Verify Cloudflare Access authentication
# GET {{apiUrl}}/auth/verify

